{"4706420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ball Champ", "steam_appid": 4706420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706420/extras/769d11da515ba2a17fe941600961b95d.avif?t=1785941375\" width=600 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706420/extras/1868ec7ede5e7b26ad5435a8a13b7185.poster.avif?t=1785941375\" width=600 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706420/extras/1868ec7ede5e7b26ad5435a8a13b7185.webm?t=1785941375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706420/extras/1868ec7ede5e7b26ad5435a8a13b7185.mp4?t=1785941375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ball Champ is a Soccer Beat ‘Em Up. Forget the rulebook. There are no offsides, no fouls, and no penalties, only you, and a relentless horde of monsters standing between you and the final whistle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706420/extras/8d3c73e9dfa4eb424bf3cf61d3060aef.avif?t=1785941375\" width=600 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706420/extras/898a405c1a489e46a04d7d3e871fe32f.poster.avif?t=1785941375\" width=600 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706420/extras/898a405c1a489e46a04d7d3e871fe32f.webm?t=1785941375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706420/extras/898a405c1a489e46a04d7d3e871fe32f.mp4?t=1785941375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demon horde is tough, and they don't play fair. To survive, you'll need more than just fancy footwork.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite Progression:</strong> Every Run is a new opportunity. Earn experience and unique skills to defeat monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Buildcraft:</strong> Choose from a massive pool of upgrades and unique items. Do you build your Striker for raw explosive power, or do you turn your Defender into an unstoppable wrecking ball? The choice is yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Combat:</strong> Prepare for a real test of skill.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706420/extras/ca9fae71a459e24733391a1905a82761.avif?t=1785941375\" width=600 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706420/extras/33eaecdc2bce25df5d889dc93613f53e.poster.avif?t=1785941375\" width=600 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706420/extras/33eaecdc2bce25df5d889dc93613f53e.webm?t=1785941375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706420/extras/33eaecdc2bce25df5d889dc93613f53e.mp4?t=1785941375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain devastating combos, unleash powerful special attacks, and dribble through enemies like they're traffic cones. Master the art of the slide-tackle and watch demons fly across the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>B</strong>all Champ combines the chaotic, combo-driven action of classic beat 'em ups with the strategic depth of a roguelite RPG. It’s fast, it’s frantic, and it’s a whole new ball game.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706420/extras/769d11da515ba2a17fe941600961b95d.avif?t=1785941375\" width=600 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706420/extras/1868ec7ede5e7b26ad5435a8a13b7185.poster.avif?t=1785941375\" width=600 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706420/extras/1868ec7ede5e7b26ad5435a8a13b7185.webm?t=1785941375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706420/extras/1868ec7ede5e7b26ad5435a8a13b7185.mp4?t=1785941375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ball Champ is a Soccer Beat ‘Em Up. Forget the rulebook. There are no offsides, no fouls, and no penalties, only you, and a relentless horde of monsters standing between you and the final whistle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706420/extras/8d3c73e9dfa4eb424bf3cf61d3060aef.avif?t=1785941375\" width=600 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706420/extras/898a405c1a489e46a04d7d3e871fe32f.poster.avif?t=1785941375\" width=600 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706420/extras/898a405c1a489e46a04d7d3e871fe32f.webm?t=1785941375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706420/extras/898a405c1a489e46a04d7d3e871fe32f.mp4?t=1785941375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demon horde is tough, and they don't play fair. To survive, you'll need more than just fancy footwork.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite Progression:</strong> Every Run is a new opportunity. Earn experience and unique skills to defeat monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Buildcraft:</strong> Choose from a massive pool of upgrades and unique items. Do you build your Striker for raw explosive power, or do you turn your Defender into an unstoppable wrecking ball? The choice is yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Combat:</strong> Prepare for a real test of skill.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706420/extras/ca9fae71a459e24733391a1905a82761.avif?t=1785941375\" width=600 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706420/extras/33eaecdc2bce25df5d889dc93613f53e.poster.avif?t=1785941375\" width=600 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706420/extras/33eaecdc2bce25df5d889dc93613f53e.webm?t=1785941375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706420/extras/33eaecdc2bce25df5d889dc93613f53e.mp4?t=1785941375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain devastating combos, unleash powerful special attacks, and dribble through enemies like they're traffic cones. Master the art of the slide-tackle and watch demons fly across the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>B</strong>all Champ combines the chaotic, combo-driven action of classic beat 'em ups with the strategic depth of a roguelite RPG. It’s fast, it’s frantic, and it’s a whole new ball game.</p>", "short_description": "A Soccer Beat 'em up game in which we fight as the street soccer team Ball Champ to save the world from the Demon King invasion.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706420/52794b67fcf4b269ff3d1e7c7fd6273868233996/header.jpg?t=1785941375", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706420/faab53d4825c0e9596154d6bf7897dcbee7808f6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785941375", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4706420/faab53d4825c0e9596154d6bf7897dcbee7808f6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785941375", "website": "https://www.torostudio.com.br/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i3-540 or AMD FX-4350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</str